ground:#555; flex-shrink:0;\" />\n        <span style=\"font-weight:700; font-size:17.6px; line-height:22px; letter-spacing:-0.35px; color:#ffffff;\">Adobe Firefly</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Headline -->\n      <h1 class=\"ff129-headline\" style=\"font-weight:800; font-size:51px; line-height:1; letter-spacing:-1.54px; color:#ffffff; max-width:641px; margin:0 auto 9.6px; text-align:center;\">\n        Remove background from your image for free.\n      </h1>\n\n      <!-- Subtext -->\n      <p style=\"font-size:14.4px; line-height:20px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9); max-width:536px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;\">\n        Easily remove the background from photos, then edit them in Adobe Firefly where you can add new backgrounds, graphics, and more.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Upload card widget -->\n      <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:center; margin-top:64px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:801px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius:16px; padding:10px;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#292929; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden;\">\n            <div class=\"ff129-hero-card\">\n\n              <!-- Left: image preview with action chip -->\n              <div class=\"ff129-hero-img\" style=\"height:296px;\">\n                <img src=\"media_frame-2147230404-image50.png\" alt=\"Original photo\" style=\"position:absolute; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; border-radius:8px; background:#3a3a3a; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\" />\n                <!-- Remove background chip -->\n                <div style=\"position:absolute; bottom:12px; left:12px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15); backdrop-filter:blur(4px); border:0.72px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-radius:7.2px; padding:11px 13px;\">\n                  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6.5px; height:16px;\">\n                    <img src=\"media_frame-2147230404-s2iconimagebackgroundremove20n.png\" alt=\"\